1
00:00:00,335 --> 00:00:02,585
(Leonard:)...is the willingness
to recognize one's mistakes.

2
00:00:02,754 --> 00:00:06,504
Madam Curie's discovery of radium
turned out to have great potential...

3
00:00:06,674 --> 00:00:10,974
(Leonard:)...even though she would later die a slow,
painful death from radiation poisoning.

4
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:15,310
(Leonard:)Another example,
from the field of Ebola research..."

5
00:00:15,475 --> 00:00:17,015
(Scene:)Leonard.

6
00:00:17,185 --> 00:00:18,765
(Penny:)Yeah?

7
00:00:21,106 --> 00:00:22,856
(Penny(hugs him):)We're okay.

8
00:00:42,502 --> 00:00:44,332
LEONARD: Six two-inch dowels?
- Check.

9
00:00:44,504 --> 00:00:46,754
- One package Philips head screws?
- Check.

10
00:00:46,923 --> 00:00:48,883
(Penny:)Guys, seriously, I grew up
on a farm, okay?

11
00:00:49,050 --> 00:00:51,260
(Penny:)I rebuilt a tractor engine
when I was, like, 12.

12
00:00:51,427 --> 00:00:54,017
(Penny:)I think I can put together
a cheap Swedish media center.

13
00:00:54,180 --> 00:00:57,020
(Leonard:)Please, we insist.
It's the least we can do, considering...

14
00:00:57,183 --> 00:00:58,263
(Sheldon:)Considering what?

15
00:00:58,434 --> 00:01:01,274
(Sheldon:)How great this place looks?

